<title>USA: Amerac holders approve reverse split.</title>
<headline>Amerac holders approve reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amerac Energy Corp said its shareholders have approved a 1-for-15 reverse stock split, effective immediately.</p>
<p>As a result of the reverse split and its recently announced $5 million equity private placement, Amerac will have about 3.9 million shares outstanding, giving it a market value of about $28.5 million based on its Nov. 20 pre-split price of $0.49 per share.</p>
<p>The Company has applied for listing on the Nasdaq National Market.</p>
</text>
